<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><A NAME="s_011"></A>LEGAL MATTERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Certain legal matters governed by the laws of
the Cayman Islands with respect to the validity of the offered securities will be opined upon for us by Maples and Calder (Hong Kong)
LLP. Certain legal matters governed by the laws of New York will be passed upon for us by Hunter Taubman Fischer &amp; Li LLC. Bevilacqua
PLLC, New York, New York, is counsel to the Placement Agent in connection with this offering.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

